            "Set to true to enable installing the logging agent into your VSI at time of creation. If true, values must be passed for `logging_target_host` and either `logging_api_key` or `logging_trusted_profile_id`. Installation logs can be found on the VSI in /run/monitoring-agent/monitoring-agent-install.log."
